{
    "title": "Driver Pulse by Tenstreet",
    "description": "The Driver Pulse app for phones and tablets is Tenstreet\u2019s first app for drivers.\r\n\r\nTenstreet is a software company focused on bringing drivers & carriers together. They work with 1,600+ carriers, 3.7+ million drivers and have managed over 17 million IntelliApp job applications.\r\n\r\nThe Driver Pulse app gives you behind-the-scenes access to a carrier's hiring process and direct access to your recruiter. Search and apply to any carrier you like. Once you do, you\u2019ll no longer be waiting in the dark for details about your application \u2013 simply text and share documents with your recruiter to keep your application in the fast lane, so you get hired today.\r\n \r\nDriver Pulse keeps you in the loop no matter where you are. Some features include:\r\n\r\n- Search for and apply to over 3,400 carriers in Driver Pulse\r\n- Create a Driver Profile to build rapport with recruiters and enable carriers to match you with their open positions\r\n- Get carrier recommendations based on previous activity and ratings\r\n- Access your background reports for free when available (PSP, CDLIS, Employment History, etc)\r\n- Have your application pre-populate so you can complete an application in minutes\r\n- Track your applications and hiring progress for each carrier \r\n- Upload and store your documents (CDL, Med Card, and Insurance) for easy sharing\r\n- Receive Greyhound bus ticket details\r\n- Refer friends to get you bonuses and incentives (when applicable)\r\n- Message with recruiters in real-time\r\n- Find safe parking spots for your semi nationwide",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Driver Pulse app for phones and tablets is Tenstreet\u2019s first app for drivers.<br><br>Tenstreet is a software company focused on bringing drivers &amp; carriers together. They work with 1,600+ carriers, 3.7+ million drivers and have managed over 17 million IntelliApp job applications.<br><br>The Driver Pulse app gives you behind-the-scenes access to a carrier&#39;s hiring process and direct access to your recruiter. Search and apply to any carrier you like. Once you do, you\u2019ll no longer be waiting in the dark for details about your application \u2013 simply text and share documents with your recruiter to keep your application in the fast lane, so you get hired today.<br> <br>Driver Pulse keeps you in the loop no matter where you are. Some features include:<br><br>- Search for and apply to over 3,400 carriers in Driver Pulse<br>- Create a Driver Profile to build rapport with recruiters and enable carriers to match you with their open positions<br>- Get carrier recommendations based on previous activity and ratings<br>- Access your background reports for free when available (PSP, CDLIS, Employment History, etc)<br>- Have your application pre-populate so you can complete an application in minutes<br>- Track your applications and hiring progress for each carrier <br>- Upload and store your documents (CDL, Med Card, and Insurance) for easy sharing<br>- Receive Greyhound bus ticket details<br>- Refer friends to get you bonuses and incentives (when applicable)<br>- Message with recruiters in real-time<br>- Find safe parking spots for your semi nationwide",
    "summary": "Driver Pulse gives you instant access to the status on your IntelliApp.",
